WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.833
Save Quality and Costing keeps the fabric too, so next
time you start from it and change only what's different.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.469
To start from a saved quality,
open Saved qualities.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.391
Search, and tap the quality to load it.

4
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:19.815
The fabric and its yarns fill
in, yarn rates included.

5
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:25.718
Then add this order's costs: crimp and
waste, weaving, overhead and margin.

6
00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.995
Open Live cost, and your price is ready.
